  "correct": "2",
  "solution": "We use the BODMAS rule to solve the equation:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/47370b0626128df212f2edfaa682c86866fe2d62d3725f3ea6cf4f4de186cf14.png] \n\nThe given equation:\n\n31*29*43*85*5\n\nWe apply each option on the given equation:\n\nOption 1) +, ×, =, -\n\n31 + **__29 × 43__** = 85 - 5\n\n**__31 + 1247__** = 85 - 5\n\n1278 = **__85 - 5__**\n\n1278 ≠ 80\n\nLHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 2) +, -, =, ÷\n\n31 + 29 - 43 = **__85 ÷ 5__**\n\n**__31 + 29__** - 43 = 17\n\n**__60 - 43__** = 17\n\n17 = 17\n\nLHS = RHS\n\nOption 3) +, +, =, ×\n\n31 + 29 + 43 = **__85 ×____ 5__**\n\n**__31 + 29 + 43__** = 425\n\n103 ≠ 425\n\nLHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4) =, +, -, ÷\n\n31 = 29 + 43 - **__85 ÷ 5__**\n\n31 = **__29 +__****__ 43__** - 17\n\n31 = **__72 -17__**\n\n31 ≠ 55\n\nLHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence option 2) is the correct answer.",
